---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../site";

const updated = "October 19, 2026";
---

<Base title="Privacy" description={`How ${site.name} handles the information you send.`}>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Last updated {updated}</p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-5 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        When you use the contact form, I get what you type: your name, email, business, location and message. When you
        book a call, Cal.com collects the details on its booking form and sends them to me. I use this only to reply to
        you and to do the work you ask for.
      </p>
      <p>
        I don't sell or share your information. Form notes are delivered to my inbox by Resend, the site is hosted on
        Vercel, and bookings are handled by Cal.com. Each has its own privacy policy.
      </p>
      <p>This site doesn't use advertising trackers.</p>
      <p>
        Want your information deleted? Send a note through the <a href="/contact/" class="underline">contact page</a>
        and I'll remove it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
